<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE SCORE 226-6 V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE SCORE 226-6 V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe scored 226 for six in their one-day 50 overs-a-side match against South Africa in Cape Town on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 226-6 innings closed (David Houghton 57 not out, Andy Waller 52) v South Africa.</p>
